{
    "info": {
        "name": "L09ClientMCP - Branch 4: Chat-Tool Integration",
        "description": "Educational API collection for demonstrating MCP Chat-Tool Integration functionality.\n\nThis collection showcases how chat conversations can automatically invoke MCP tools when appropriate.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n- Application running on localhost:8080\n- OPENAI_API_KEY environment variable set\n- Start with `mcp-stdio` profile for MCP tool integration\n\n**Branch 4 Features:**\n- Chat requests that trigger MCP tool usage\n- Automatic tool detection from user messages\n- Tool result integration into conversation responses\n- Graceful fallback when tools unavailable\n\n**Learning Objectives:**\n- Experience AI-driven tool selection\n- See tool results integrated into natural conversation\n- Understand chat-tool integration patterns\n- Compare tool-enhanced vs standard responses",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "Health Check - MCP Integration Status",
            "event": [
                {
                    "listen": "test",
                    "script": {
                        "exec": [
                            "pm.test('Health check returns 200', function () {",
                            "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                            "});",
                            "",
                            "pm.test('Response contains expected message', function () {",
                            "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('Chat service is running');",
                            "});",
                            "",
                            "pm.test('Response includes MCP status', function () {",
                            "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('MCP:');",
                            "});",
                            "",
                            "// Extract and log MCP status for educational purposes",
                            "const responseText = pm.response.text();",
                            "const mcpMatch = responseText.match(/MCP: (\\w+) \\(([^)]+)\\)/);",
                            "if (mcpMatch) {",
                            "    console.log('✅ Chat service is healthy');",
                            "    console.log('🔧 MCP Status: ' + mcpMatch[1] + ' - ' + mcpMatch[2]);",
                            "    if (mcpMatch[1] === 'enabled') {",
                            "        console.log('🛠️  Tool integration is active - chat can use MCP tools');",
                            "    } else {",
                            "        console.log('📵 Tool integration disabled - chat uses standard AI only');",
                            "    }",
                            "} else {",
                            "    console.log('✅ Chat service is healthy');",
                            "    console.log('ℹ️  MCP status format may have changed');",
                            "}"
                        ],
                        "type": "text/javascript"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat/health",
                    "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                    "path": ["api", "chat", "health"]
                },
                "description": "**Purpose:** Verify the application and MCP integration status.\n\n**What to expect:**\n- Status: 200 OK\n- Response includes MCP integration status\n- Tool availability information\n\n**Branch 4 Focus:**\n- Check if chat-tool integration is active\n- Verify MCP tools are available for chat usage\n- Foundation for testing tool-enhanced conversations"
            },
            "response": []
        },
        {
            "name": "Chat - Echo Tool Request",
            "event": [
                {
                    "listen": "test",
                    "script": {
                        "exec": [
                            "pm.test('Chat request successful', function () {",
                            "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                            "});",
                            "",
                            "pm.test('Response has correct structure', function () {",
                            "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                            "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('response');",
                            "    pm.expect(jsonData.response).to.be.a('string');",
                            "});",
                            "",
                            "pm.test('Response indicates tool usage', function () {",
                            "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                            "    const response = jsonData.response.toLowerCase();",
                            "    // Should mention using the echo tool",
                            "    pm.expect(response).to.include('echo tool');",
                            "});",
                            "",
                            "pm.test('Response contains echoed message', function () {",
                            "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                            "    const response = jsonData.response;",
                            "    // Should contain the echoed text",
                            "    pm.expect(response).to.include('Hello from Branch 4');",
                            "});",
                            "",
                            "console.log('🤖 Tool-Enhanced Response:');",
                            "console.log(pm.response.json().response);"
                        ],
                        "type": "text/javascript"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "mode": "raw",
                    "raw": "{\n    \"message\": \"echo Hello from Branch 4!\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat",
                    "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                    "path": ["api", "chat"]
                },
                "description": "**Purpose:** Test automatic echo tool invocation through chat.\n\n**What to expect:**\n- Chat detects echo request in user message\n- Automatically invokes MCP echo tool\n- Returns tool result integrated into conversation\n\n**Branch 4 Features:**\n- Tool detection from natural language\n- Automatic tool invocation\n- Tool result integration into chat response\n\n**Teaching Points:**\n- No direct API calls to tools needed\n- Chat intelligence handles tool selection\n- Natural conversation flow maintained"
            },
            "response": []
        },
