                    "mode": "raw",
                    "raw": "{\n    \"message\": \"What's the weather like today?\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat",
                    "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                    "path": ["api", "chat"]
                },
                "description": "**Purpose:** Test that non-tool requests use standard AI responses.\n\n**What to expect:**\n- Chat processes request normally\n- No MCP tools invoked\n- Standard AI knowledge response\n\n**Branch 4 Comparison:**\n- Shows selective tool usage\n- Demonstrates intelligent tool detection\n- Proves tools don't interfere with normal chat\n\n**Teaching Points:**\n- Tools enhance but don't replace AI capabilities\n- Automatic tool selection based on request type\n- Seamless integration preserves normal chat flow"
            },
            "response": []
